{
  "asyncapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Listen along (WebSocket)",
    "version": "v1",
    "description": "Listen along provides shared listening rooms: one host controls playback and the queue, and all listeners stay synchronized.\n\nEach room is a Cloudflare Durable Object. After the WebSocket connects, the server sends a `RoomState` snapshot. Subsequent updates are incremental JSON messages.\n\nAll messages, in both directions, use this envelope:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"Play\", \"payload\": null }\n```\n\n**Keepalive:** send `{ \"type\": \"Ping\" }` approximately every 30 seconds. The server replies with `{ \"type\": \"Pong\" }`. Connections idle for 3 minutes are closed.\n\n**Permissions:** the host and co-hosts control playback and the queue. Other listeners can chat, and can add songs or use song commands when the room allows it. Messages the sender is not permitted to send are ignored.\n\nWebSocket requests cannot be sent from this page. Example using the browser console:\n\n```js\nconst ws = new WebSocket(\"wss://listen-along.neurokaraoke.com/ws?inviteCode=ABC123&guestId=\" + crypto.randomUUID());\nws.onmessage = e => console.log(JSON.parse(e.data));\n```"
  },
  "defaultContentType": "application/json",
  "servers": {
    "production": {
      "host": "listen-along.neurokaraoke.com",
      "protocol": "wss",
      "description": "Listen along worker."
    }
  },
  "channels": {
    "room": {
      "address": "/ws",
      "title": "A listen along room",
      "description": "Specify exactly one of:\n\n- `action=create` to create a room (requires a token. Guests cannot host)\n- `roomId` to join a room returned by `/rooms/public`\n- `inviteCode` to join via an invite link\n\nIdentify the caller with `token` (the neurokaraoke.com `authToken`) or, for guests, `guestId` (any UUID). `displayName`, `avatarUrl`, `frameTheme` and `level` are shown in the listener list.\n\nWhen creating a room, the following are also accepted: `roomName`, `isPublic` (default true), `allowListenerAddSongs`, `allowListenerSongCommands`, `allowDuplicateSongs`, `listenerAddSongCooldownSeconds` and `autoRemovePlayedSongs`.",
      "bindings": {
        "ws": {
          "method": "GET",
          "query": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "action": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Possible values: `create`"
              },
              "roomId": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "inviteCode": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "token": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Bearer token from neurokaraoke.com. Omit to connect as a guest."
              },
              "guestId": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Any UUID. Reuse the same value to keep a stable guest identity."
              },
              "displayName": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "avatarUrl": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "frameTheme": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "level": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "roomName": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "isPublic": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": true
              },
              "allowListenerAddSongs": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false
              },
              "allowListenerSongCommands": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false
              },
              "allowDuplicateSongs": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false
              },
              "listenerAddSongCooldownSeconds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "default": 0
              },
              "autoRemovePlayedSongs": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "messages": {
        "Ping": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/Ping"
        },
        "Play": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/Play"
        },
        "Pause": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/Pause"
        },
        "Seek": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/Seek"
        },
        "SkipNext": {
